<task>
Rename RPG items whose names are duplicated or use banned words.
</task>
Here is a list of items to rename:
<itemsToRegenerateName>
{% for item in itemNameRegen.items %}
<item>
  <id>{{ item.id }}</id>
  <oldName>{{ item.name }}</oldName>
  <description>{{ item.description }}</description>
</item>
{% endfor %}
</itemsToRegenerateName>

{% if itemNameRegen.bannedWords and itemNameRegen.bannedWords.length %}
Banned words:
{% for word in itemNameRegen.bannedWords %}{{ word }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}

Based on the context above, give each item in the itemsToRegenerateName list a different name that fits the setting and culture{% if itemNameRegen.bannedWords and itemNameRegen.bannedWords.length %}, and does not use any of the banned words{% endif %}. Provide 10 candidate names per item. Replace the old name in the description with the placeholder %NAME% to indicate where the new name will go.

Return them in this format:

<items>
  <item>
    <id>original item id</id>
    <oldName>original item name</oldName>
    <name>new item name</name>
    <name>...</name>
    <!-- a total of 10 proposed names for the item -->
    <description>updated description</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    ... the rest of the items, if more than one ...
  </item>
</items>

Only include XML described above—no commentary, bullet lists, or additional text.
